SY_TALK("B2goIAJYkkw",[[2,["...the Hindu Scriptures, the experiences"]],[6,["described in more detail than in Christian Scriptures."]],[10,["And we are told that you should be able to feel vibrations"]],[17,["emitting from the crown of your head once you have the awakening,"]],[21,["like a cool wind, and you should also feel them on your hands."]],[28,["And in Muslim Scriptures it's described as the Ruh."]],[33,["And Mohammed said, \"I believe that at this time"]],[39,["people would become enlightened and their hands would speak\"."]],[42,["And once you have the experience of the awakening,"]],[47,["your fingers become sensitive to the vibrations"]],[51,["in yourself and in other people and you can tell"]],[55,["exactly what the condition of each person is and how their"]],[60,["chakras are working or if there is a problem there."]],[63,["And because the vibrations flow through,"]],[69,["through our hands and through our body"]],[72,["and emit through our head, and"]],[75,["if you sit with your hands in this position,"]],[79,["you'll probably start to feel"]],[82,["the awakening coming while Mother's talking."]],[87,["And it's something that takes you beyond thought."]],[93,["You won't,"]],[94,["you don't have to think about it or have a great intellectual"]],[97,["understanding, to appreciate it."]],[100,["In fact children probably appreciate it more than rest of us"]],[104,["and always at first and because it is such a"]],[109,["true experience."]],[112,["So if you would just be receptive and"]],[117,["not try and think of,"]],[121,["worry about any words that seem a little bit"]],[124,["different to what you are used to hearing,"]],[126,["just enjoy the experience.Thank you."]],[135,["I won't keep you any longer."]],[138,["Shri Mataji has arrived in Perth,"]],[141,["from an, what is an extensive, overseas tour, and"]],[146,["I've been with Her now for the best part of two months and"]],[148,["we've been visiting many, many countries and"]],[151,["at last She has come to my own country which is Australia."]],[155,["Perth of course is the gateway to Australia and.."]],[158,["I never see it, although I am from Sidney,"]],[161,["I never see Sidney as the gateway."]],[163,["To me the West is where so much begins today."]],[171,["There are so many seekers here."]],[173,["Perth has very beautiful vibrations because we feel these vibrations"]],[177,["and Mataji Herself has commented what"]],[181,["beautiful seekers there are in this city."]],[186,["There is seeking in each one of us and"]],[188,["Linda has spoken very sweetly about that seeking, that"]],[192,["that urge, that we want to be something higher,"]],[195,["that we want to achieve something beyond this"]],[199,["human existence, the confusion  and the"]],[202,["frustration, that we face from time to time."]],[206,["Not only from time to time but probably most of our daily life."]],[212,["Shri Mataji is the One who can take you beyond this."]],[216,["And She said \"beyond thought\", but"]],[219,["the experience of Self-realisation is something"]],[223,["which you begin to perceive in your central nervous system."]],[229,["You become an enlightened being and the process is one of growth,"]],[234,["from that point onwards to the full experience of Self-realisation."]],[239,["It's an actualisation in other words."]],[242,["It's a spontaneous happening that occurs."]],[245,["She often says that on the tree of life"]],[249,["at first there were just a few flowers"]],[252,["that turned to fruit. Now it's the blossom time and the"]],[257,["flowers are everywhere and all of them have to turn to fruit."]],[264,["This is what it is now and the grace of God is overflowing"]],[269,["in such a way, that all of us can achieve that next step that,"]],[276,["that last jump in our awareness."]],[282,["We can become a spiritual being."]],[286,["We can be beyond thought and yet we can use thought."]],[290,["We can be beyond emotion and yet we can still enjoy,"]],[295,["and feel emotion."]],[298,["In other words we become the Spirit."]],[301,["And this is the purpose of Mother's visit."]],[303,["We call Her Mother, Mataji means \"the Divine Mother\"."]],[307,["She's known throughout the world as"]],[310,["that being who has come on the earth to just do one job,"]],[315,["that is to awaken the subtle energy that lies"]],[318,["in the sacrum, at the base of the spine. And when that energy rises,"]],[324,["very sweetly and very painlessly,"]],[327,["the actualisation of your second birth takes place."]],[331,["Christ has spoken about it as She said, Mohammed spoke about it."]],[337,["All the great prophets and saints have spoken about it."]],[341,["And now the time has come. It seems too hard to believe,"]],[344,["but this is what is happening to thousands of people."]],[348,["Already in Australia on the east coast,"]],[351,["near the cities Sahaja Yoga is well established."]],[354,["I can see from the audience here that"]],[356,["it's going to be well established from now on in Perth."]],[360,["So without any further introduction from me,"]],[364,["I'd like to introduce to you, Her Holiness Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[388,["I think You are connected to the mains."]],[401,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[408,["It's very nice to come back to Australia for the second time."]],[418,["And last time I could not come to Perth."]],[426,["I did not know that it was such a beautiful city,"]],[430,["with such beautiful, spiritual vibrations."]],[436,["What Linda has talked to you or Dr. Warren has told you,"]],[444,["is the knowledge of the roots."]],[449,["Now what we know through science or through our human senses,"]],[458,["is the knowledge of the tree that we see obviously before us."]],[465,["But this is the knowledge of the root"]],[471,["and if you have to nourish"]],[477,["the plant, you have to water the roots."]],[482,["No use just plucking up some flowers,"]],[486,["or some leaves and treating them with something artificial."]],[495,["This knowledge can only be achieved,"]],[500,["if you can somehow or other go to the roots."]],[505,["For example you are paying attention to Me just now."]],[509,["But if I say, \" Please pay attention to yourself\", you cannot do it."]],[516,["You say, \"How Mother? How to do it?\""]],[520,["So something has to happen within you,"]],[523,["which should attract your attention inside,"]],[529,["so that you can get your attention which is outside,"]],[537,["in connection with the Spirit."]],[541,["And the attention then can be enlightened by the Spirit."]],[546,["So to know the knowledge of this root,"]],[550,["you have to become something more than a human being."]],[557,["Even Darwin, who did not believe in God,"]],[560,["did say very clearly, that if man has come so far,"]],[566,["he has to go little further to explain himself."]],[573,["But as he did not try the knowledge of the roots,"]],[579,["whatever he said, was about what he saw apparently, outside."]],[589,["To become the subtle has to be something very spontaneous."]],[598,["Has to be something very spontaneous."]],[601,["It cannot be done by thinking or by reading."]],[607,["Some people believe, that if we read, we will go to God,"]],[612,["or if we think about God, we'll go to God."]],[615,["It's not true. If it was so,"]],[620,["why did Christ say that you are to be born again?"]],[623,["Why did all of them say that"]],[626,["some transformation has to take place within you?"]],[629,["Even Buddha has said that you have to get your Self-realisation."]],[633,["Without that He would not talk about God."]],[638,["So something has to happen within us to transform us."]],[645,["The other idea people have, is - beg your pardon?"]],[649,["Sorry, we have to leave early."]],[651,["All right, you come along tomorrow. All right? May God bless you."]],[659,["So something has to happen within us which is spontaneous."]],[666,["Because if our spiritual ascent has been"]],[676,["the result of a living process,"]],[683,["the further movement has to be living again."]],[689,["So we have to understand first point, logically we should understand"]],[695,["what we should expect about Self-realisation,"]],[698,["that it has to be spontaneous."]],[702,["You cannot work it out,"]],[705,["you cannot become."]],[713,["You became human beings spontaneously,"]],[717,["from amoeba stage to this stage."]],[719,["And if you have to become something more it has to be"]],[724,["spontaneous by the force which resides within you."]],[728,["Like the force that resides in a seed,"]],[734,["which spontaneously becomes"]],[740,["germinated when it is put in the Mother Earth."]],[747,["If you read a book, you cannot do it."]],[750,["If you stand on your head, you can't do it."]],[752,["If you jump, you do what you like, it's not going to happen."]],[756,["You have to put it in the womb of the Mother Earth,"]],[761,["so that the seed should be germinated."]],[764,["Is the capacity of the Mother Earth,"]],[767,["is the quality of the Mother Earth,"]],[769,["that gives that spontaneous germination to a seed."]],[775,["Now every day in life we see so many living things happening,"]],[780,["like a flower becoming a fruit."]],[787,["But we take it for granted."]],[790,["We don't understand that we cannot transform a flower into a fruit."]],[796,["We cannot do anything that is living."]],[799,["What we can do is the dead work."]],[801,["If a tree dies, all right, so we make a beautiful furniture."]],[806,["Or something dead is converted into another form of dead,"]],[811,["which also deaden us with habits."]],[815,["So the work of the Divine"]],[820,["or the All Pervading Power of Love of God,"]],[825,["is living work of the living God."]],[829,["And that power we know it exists"]],[833,["but we are not aware of it"]],[836,["and we cannot feel it on the central nervous system."]],[843,["When people talk about the All Pervading Power, it's a mystery."]],[849,["They talk about the Holy Ghost. This is another mystery."]],[853,["Everything seems to be a mystery"]],[855,["before you have got your Realisation."]],[859,["For example this instrument is made"]],[862,["and is not connected to the mains."]],[866,["It's a mystery. Nobody knows what is it for,"]],[869,["what's the purpose of this instrument is."]],[871,["But once it is put to the mains,"]],[874,["you start seeing how fantastic it is, how tremendous it is."]],[880,["One can't believe when they say that in Sahaja Yoga"]],[885,["you receive all these powers of your own."]],[887,["One can't believe it, because they think, \"How can it be possible?\""]],[892,["But for your information, you are a fantastic being made by God."]],[898,["And this is the instrument,"]],[900,["that is lying within you in a subtle form."]],[903,["Now when I'm talking to you, you have to know one more thing,"]],[908,["that you should keep an open mind to listen to Me,"]],[912,["like a scientist does."]],[915,["It's a hypothesis for you and it's truth for Me."]],[920,["All right. If it is proofed to be truth for you"]],[923,["then you should go forward with it and try to understand,"]],[928,["how the truth is being established  logically within you."]],[936,["At the very outset I've seen people have doubts about the Divine."]],[942,["They start asking, \"Mother how is it possible,"]],[945,["that we can get it so easily?"]],[948,["How one can get realisation so easily?"]],[951,["We have to cleanse it, we have to suffer, we have to do this.\""]],[955,["Perhaps you do not know, that when we use an electric switch,"]],[964,["we do not think, what has gone in the history,"]],[969,["what people have suffered in the history"]],[972,["in creating that little switch."]],[976,["It has taken ages for this switch to come up,"]],[981,["to discover the electricity, the working of it and the whole, whole"]],[987,["development of electrical appliances, till we got the switch."]],[992,["Now we only know we have to switch on and we get the lights."]],[996,["But when I say that you don't have to do anything else,"]],[1000,["you are not to suffer,"]],[1001,["you must know somebody has suffered for you on the cross."]],[1006,["Somebody has done the cleansing part of it,"]],[1010,["and you cannot cleanse yourself unless and until you are out of it."]],[1017,["If you have to cleanse your car, you have to get out of it."]],[1022,["That is why first of all you must get your Self-realisation,"]],[1027,["the light of your being, the purpose of your life, the absolute."]],[1034,["She has already explained to you the chart,"]],[1037,["that is the instrument, the subtle instrument that is within you."]],[1043,["Now here the chart is showing you all the different centers,"]],[1047,["but these centers are manifested also in the gross as plexuses."]],[1055,["We have first of all the Mooladhara chakra."]],[1059,["This chakra is the center which controls actually the pelvic plexus,"]],[1065,["through which all our excretion takes place."]],[1069,["It's a very important center, Mooladhara,"]],[1072,["means the support of the root."]],[1075,["Is the support of the root, is the center"]],[1078,["of the support of the root."]],[1082,["Is a very, very important center, because"]],[1085,["this represents our innocence."]],[1089,["In the subtle it is the innocence in us,"]],[1093,["which looks after this center."]],[1098,["Through our ignorance or through our naiveness,"]],[1103,["we loose our innocence."]],[1105,["But actually innocence can never be lost,"]],[1108,["only it is tarnished or covered by our stupidity maybe,"]],[1114,["by our wrong doings to ourselves."]],[1117,["It exists all the time,"]],[1119,["and when the Kundalini rises which is above that,"]],[1123,["which is coiled up into three and a half coils,"]],[1127,["this chakra becomes aware of itself."]],[1130,["The deity of innocence within it gets awakened"]],[1134,["and one starts feeling the innocence within one's personality."]],[1142,["The Kundalini itself, this residual power of desire,"]],[1147,["is placed in the triangular bone."]],[1150,["The triangular bone is the bone called as sacrum."]],[1155,["It's a Greek word, meaning sacred."]],[1158,["So the Greek knew that this"]],[1163,["triangular bone contained something sacred."]],[1166,["And when I went to Greece and asked them,"]],[1168,["\"How is it you call it sacrum?\","]],[1170,["they said, \"There has been a report, Indo-Aryan report,"]],[1174,["much before Alexander, where we came to know about this bone,"]],[1178,["that it is a sacred bone and it has a special power within it.\""]],[1184,["Now this Kundalini is a power which is the pure desire,"]],[1190,["is the power of pure desire."]],[1193,["While the other, if you see the blue line,"]],[1196,["the left side power within us,"]],[1200,["which starts from the right at the back and goes to the left,"]],[1205,["is the power of desire."]],[1209,["But not pure desire, because this can be made impured."]],[1214,["And all other desires but the desire to be one with the Divine,"]],[1221,["are corruptible, can be wrong, can be confusing."]],[1226,["As you know in economics it is said, that"]],[1230,["no desire is satiable in general,"]],[1233,["because you want to buy a house, you want to buy a car,"]],[1235,["then you want to buy that and you buy another thing."]],[1238,["You are never satisfied with matter."]],[1241,["So this desire which is lying in the sacrum bone"]],[1245,["absolutely in its pure form,"]],[1247,["the pure desire to be one with the Divine,"]],[1250,["is the one that gives you ultimate satisfaction and joy."]],[1256,["It is so spontaneous, that if people ask Me, \"How You do it?\","]],[1260,["is going to be difficult to explain at this level how it is done."]],[1265,["As you cannot explain how a seed germinates"]],[1269,["and how it becomes a tree."]],[1271,["All living things cannot be explained,"]],[1273,["only to be seen and to be felt within yourself."]],[1280,["I will be able to tell you tomorrow more about these centers,"]],[1284,["what are these centers and what are they related to you."]],[1287,["In any case I hope you have the books now and"]],[1290,["when you go, you can take these books with you and read them at home"]],[1295,["and see for yourself, if you can understand,"]],[1299,["what's written in those books."]],[1301,["But here today as an introduction, I would like to tell you"]],[1305,["certain questions all these people have in their mind."]],[1308,["For example there have been many fake gurus coming from India"]],[1312,["and they have been enticing many people abroad."]],[1316,["And most of the newspaper people ask Me about them."]],[1319,["So I have to tell that you of course can blame these fake gurus,"]],[1325,["no doubt, that they are sinister, they have been devilish,"]],[1328,["they have been money oriented, I agree."]],[1331,["But also that a seeker has to use his brains"]],[1335,["and must understand, what he is seeking."]],[1338,["If we just blind folded go to these gurus, then"]],[1343,["what can one do about it? It's very sad, because they are so naive,"]],[1347,["they must understand what we are seeking, what we are expecting,"]],[1351,["and what should happen to us."]],[1356,["Now, some people don't understand that you cannot pay for God."]],[1365,["You have not paid anything for becoming a human being."]],[1368,["He doesn't understand money."]],[1370,["Money is created only by human beings."]],[1373,["God has not created money. He doesn't understand money at all."]],[1377,["You cannot purchase God, you cannot purchase this knowledge,"]],[1381,["you cannot purchase your realisation."]],[1383,["None of the things that are related with God,"]],[1386,["can be purchased with money."]],[1389,["Anybody who tries to take money from you,"]],[1392,["in the name of God, is a parasite."]],[1394,["Not only a parasite,"]],[1400,["but I would say a person who is anti-God."]],[1406,["Because that is how he is maligning the name of God."]],[1410,["It cannot be purchased, it cannot be sold, it cannot be organised,"]],[1417,["it cannot be manoeuvred."]],[1419,["We cannot have aa organisation of God."]],[1423,["We cannot organise Him. He is the way He is."]],[1428,["We cannot tell Him now, \"You come along every Sunday to our church\"."]],[1432,["He won't. It is His desire, if He wants to do it"]],[1436,["or if He doesn't want to do it."]],[1438,["The only thing that binds God is love, dedication and truthfulness."]],[1444,["If you are truthful, if you are dedicated,"]],[1447,["then God is interested in you."]],[1449,["If you are not, He is not at all interested in people,"]],[1453,["who are seeking not God but something else."]],[1457,["But what is most unfortunate, that the people who are mislaid,"]],[1462,["are all seekers of God."]],[1464,["They are all seekers of truth, they are true people,"]],[1468,["they are honest, they are dedicated and they are exploited."]],[1472,["So again I would say, anybody who takes money in the name of God,"]],[1477,["please see that, that is not God, please!"]],[1480,["As a Mother I'm warning you, that one has to understand,"]],[1483,["any saint who takes money in the name of God is"]],[1487,["not a person, who is to be regarded as a divine personality,"]],[1493,["by no chance a saint."]],[1495,["Now secondly, as I told you, you cannot put in an effort,"]],[1499,["it is a spontaneous happening."]],[1502,["Now one of the arguments people have, that in such and such book,"]],[1506,["X, Y, Z this is written."]],[1508,["In the other book so and so, this is written."]],[1512,["Another fellow who was such and such has said so."]],[1518,["It's very easy to dwell upon such sayings and on such books."]],[1523,["I would request you to be here at this moment with Me,"]],[1528,["to understand what I have to say."]],[1530,["If you bring in other people,"]],[1532,["I'll have to tell you the facts about them,"]],[1534,["which you may not like, which will not be palatable."]],[1537,["We'll create a controversy for nothing at all."]],[1539,["Because we are not here to create any controversies."]],[1542,["We are here to achieve our goal of Self-realisation"]],[1545,["for our betterment."]],[1548,["Once you understand this, that the main interest is of the Divine"]],[1553,["and that is, that you all should get your Self-realisation."]],[1558,["We have known that we have become human beings."]],[1561,["But we have never asked a question, no scientist has asked a question:"]],[1565,["Why have we become a human being?"]],[1567,["Why are we on this earth moving"]],[1570,["with these two legs and two feet in this fashion?"]],[1572,["What is the speciality, why God has made us"]],[1576,["in such a beautiful way, that we are called as human beings?"]],[1580,["If you ask this question to yourself, you won't be able to say"]],[1583,["that there is any purpose in what God has done to us."]],[1587,["But I say, there is a purpose!"]],[1589,["The purpose is that you have to become the instrument of God."]],[1593,["You have to become the carrier of His power."]],[1599,["When the Kundalini rises and breaks through your seventh chakra here,"]],[1605,["then it is amazing how you feel this All Pervading Power"]],[1608,["as cool breeze in your hands. But that's not sufficient."]],[1612,["If you feel the cool breeze, supposing I give you a car"]],[1615,["or any instrument and I don't tell you how to drive, it is useless."]],[1620,["But if you learn the complete decoding of this feeling"]],[1624,["of this All Pervading Power, you can do great things,"]],[1629,["because God has put these powers within you,"]],[1632,["only the light has to come in."]],[1635,["Without the light as you cannot see anything properly,"]],[1638,["you cannot integrate anything, correlate anything."]],[1640,["In the same way, when there is no light within yourself,"]],[1644,["you are not integrated within, nor you understand absolute things."]],[1651,["What you understand are relative things."]],[1654,["With our mind projection whatever we do is all relative."]],[1658,["That's why we are having problems about our politics,"]],[1662,["about our economics, about our every sort of thing that we are doing."]],[1668,["Our development also has been very one-sided in the sense,"]],[1673,["that our material development has taken place"]],[1676,["without the Spirit in it."]],[1678,["Anything without the Spirit is something like a tree"]],[1681,["growing, outgrowing it's size much more than the roots"]],[1686,["and that's how sometimes we always are worried and shocked"]],[1691,["at the destruction, that is facing us from within and without."]],[1697,["We see diseases like cancer and other horrible diseases,"]],[1701,["which we cannot combat."]],[1703,["We see the problems of the nations and political, economic crises,"]],[1708,["and we don't understand how to control it on individual basis."]],[1712,["All these things can only be solved if you become the Spirit."]],[1717,["The Spirit is within you the link with the whole."]],[1722,["Like the microcosm, the whole, you are a part and parcel of that."]],[1727,["Like my finger is part and parcel of the whole."]],[1729,["Now, if there is pain in my finger, I can feel the whole."]],[1734,["In the same way once I become aware of My Spirit,"]],[1737,["I can feel the whole, I become collectively conscious."]],[1741,["I do not talk about it, I do not say that"]],[1744,["'You are now brothers and sisters', but it just happens that"]],[1748,["on your fingertips you start feeling others, very clearly,"]],[1752,["their centres, their problems, your problems"]],[1755,["and also you know methods how to clear it out."]],[1759,["Compassion people talk of, of giving compassion,"]],[1762,["looking after people and doing good to them."]],[1765,["But this compassion talks, it doesn't solve the problem."]],[1769,["But the compassion that flows from you, works. It works out."]],[1773,["It helps people in a way that they are not aware of it."]],[1777,["For example in India we had one Indian,"]],[1781,["who got realisation in a village."]],[1782,["He was a farmer, he went back,"]],[1785,["and he gave realisation to so many people, and it is unbelievable,"]],[1789,["how he could manage such a lot of population to come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1796,["But he told Me that certain incidents"]],[1798,["like, 'A man came to me and he was an alcoholic,"]],[1805,["and he came to me and he was about to beat me."]],[1808,["But I was very quiet. I just told him,"]],[1811,["\"Now don't beat me, you sit down for a while\"."]],[1813,["He sat down and after some time, I awakened his Kundalini."]],[1817,["Overnight he gave up alcohol!"]],[1820,["Overnight he gave it up."]],[1821,["He became like a king. He said, \"What?"]],[1824,["I'm not going to drink anymore\".'"]],[1825,["It's not mental, but just he achieved his supreme thing,"]],[1831,["the highest thing, his purpose and the whole being got glorified."]],[1838,["So you start feeling your own powers."]],[1842,["Actually when you go to any guru, you must also find out"]],[1846,["from the disciples, if they have achieved any powers or not."]],[1850,["It is not important if a guru says, \"I am such and such\"."]],[1853,["For example, the lady who came to interview Me, she said,"]],[1857,["\"Do You think you are the highest saint of India?\" and all that."]],[1861,["I said, \"I never said so. But the saints in India do say so.\""]],[1865,["All right. If you believe in it or not makes no difference."]],[1868,["It is for you to find out. But leave alone Me,"]],[1871,["why not find out about yourself, what happens to you."]],[1874,["Supposing you become the saint, supposing you have the powers,"]],[1879,["supposing you manifest that compassion which I am talking of,"]],[1882,["then you have to believe that there is something about yourself."]],[1885,["First of all you all must have faith in yourselves,"]],[1888,["that you are capable of becoming that Self,"]],[1892,["which is collectively conscious to begin with,"]],[1896,["which is the source of all the joy, health, wealth"]],[1902,["and all kinds of satisfaction,"]],[1905,["and the one which is the witness of the play of Divine,"]],[1909,["the one that allows you to transmit this Divine power to others."]],[1915,["After realisation, for example Dr. Warren himself"]],[1919,["was very reluctant in the beginning."]],[1921,["He was a difficult person to begin with."]],[1924,["Then he got his realisation"]],[1926,["and after realisation he was quite satisfied."]],[1929,["Because he had been to so many gurus."]],[1931,["There's no guru he had not been."]],[1933,["And he was so angry and aggressive when he came to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1940,["When he got into realisation, he just felt that he has found it."]],[1945,["Now, through him in Australia we have established"]],[1949,["so many centres, and so many people have got realisation."]],[1953,["It's a surprising thing that one man,"]],[1956,["who reluctantly came to Me on a telephone number,"]],[1960,["has suddenly become such an enlightened person,"]],[1964,["that he has given realisation to so many people,"]],[1967,["and to whom he has given realisation, have"]],[1971,["also given Realisation to so many others."]],[1973,["Apart from that they have cured diseases like cancer"]],[1978,["and all kinds of serious diseases we talk about. It's a fact."]],[1982,["For this you cannot pay. That's one thing for sure."]],[1986,["You cannot pay for it. It's all free."]],[1988,["As this nature is free to give you everything"]],[1992,["that is essential and vital within you."]],[1994,["In the same way this knowledge has to be without any effort."]],[2000,["Supposing if we have to learn about breathing,"]],[2004,["going to a library, how many of us would survive?"]],[2008,["It is so vital that it has to be the easiest, the simplest"]],[2012,["and everything that is living is so simple,"]],[2015,["that we don't also bother to think about it."]],[2019,["We take all this for granted."]],[2024,["The subject is very wide."]],[2027,["It has many aspects and dimensions."]],[2030,["First when the Kundalini rises, it crosses through this center,"]],[2035,["which is called as the Agnya chakra,"]],[2037,["which is the chakra of our Lord Jesus Christ."]],[2042,["Tomorrow I'll be telling you the names of all the deities,"]],[2045,["who reside on these centers."]],[2047,["Now it is difficult for a scientist to accept,"]],[2050,["that there are deities who are sitting on these chakras."]],[2054,["But Socrates and Confucius who were such ancient people,"]],[2058,["have talked about these Gods, that we have to keep them pleased"]],[2063,["and you have to keep them all right."]],[2065,["But those realised souls perhaps you don't know."]],[2067,["That's not easy to convince human beings who are not realised souls"]],[2072,["about these deities being within you."]],[2077,["And they are all just waiting there."]],[2080,["As soon as the Kundalini rises you start manifesting your grandeur,"]],[2085,["your great personality that awaits you."]],[2089,["This is something not fantastic to Me,"]],[2092,["because I've seen thousands of people getting realisation,"]],[2097,["thousands of them feeling the cool breeze,"]],[2099,["thousands of them transforming."]],[2102,["Another thing one has to see in a person, in a guru,"]],[2105,["when you go to a guru, that"]],[2108,["'Is this the man giving any transformation to another person?'"]],[2112,["Here they are, they are smuggling, they are telling lies,"]],[2115,["they are killing people and they have a guru."]],[2117,["How can you have a guru,"]],[2119,["when you are doing all these anti-God activities?"]],[2122,["All kinds of anti-God activities they are doing:"]],[2124,["They are hot-tempered, they are liars, they are intriguers,"]],[2130,["all sorts of things they'll be doing"]],[2132,["and they will be saying that \"We have a guru\"."]],[2136,["What's the use of such a guru, who allows you to do these things?"]],[2139,["It's better not to have such a guru who allows you to do that."]],[2142,["Secondly, a guru if you have a real one,"]],[2145,["he has to look after your health, minimum of minimum."]],[2148,["But if you go to a guru and if you get epilepsy"]],[2151,["or if you go to a guru and you get a bad head"]],[2154,["or some sort of a headache, then he says,"]],[2157,["\"All right, these are your sins, you better suffer\"."]],[2160,["So one should ask a question to such a guru,"]],[2162,["that, \"Then why are you there? Why are we paying you for?"]],[2166,["If you can't even look after our health,what are we paying you for?\""]],[2170,["There could be a guru who can teach you something,"]],[2173,["like he'll say that, \"I'll make you fly\"."]],[2175,["So you must ask the guru to fly himself."]],[2178,["If the guru can fly, then you pay him."]],[2180,["What's the use of paying a guru who just says, you can fly."]],[2183,["\"All right, you give me six thousand pounds, I'll make you fly.\""]],[2186,["Better ask the guru to fly and see that he flies."]],[2189,["But people are so identified with the gurus,"]],[2191,["that despite they become absolutely bankrupt, finished,"]],[2195,["gone cases, still they are sticking on to these gurus,"]],[2198,["because they are mesmerised."]],[2200,["They don't want to have their own Self-realisation,"]],[2203,["they don't want to have their own powers,"]],[2205,["but they want to abide by the so-called powers of their guru"]],[2209,["and all these things. They become absolutely hopeless cases,"]],[2212,["gone cases, good for nothing, lost people,"]],[2216,["but still they'll stick on to these people and"]],[2219,["will continue with it till they are perished as useless cabbages."]],[2223,["It's a very common thing, I've seen of some of the people"]],[2226,["who teach that you must starve now, you must starve."]],[2229,["And the guru eats well,"]],[2230,["but all the disciples are starving and suffering."]],[2233,["There's one thing more in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2235,["you are not supposed to suffer anymore."]],[2237,["There's no need to suffer."]],[2242,["Christ has suffered. He has suffered for us."]],[2244,["Now, no more suffering is needed for anyone of you."]],[2248,["Tomorrow I'll tell you how, when Christ is awakened,"]],[2251,["you can feel"]],[2254,["your so-called karmas and your so-called"]],[2257,["egos and all that just are sucked in."]],[2260,["Here as you will see, ego is created with this right side power"]],[2266,["called as the kriya shakti, is the power of action."]],[2271,["And when it moves further and further and touches the other side"]],[2275,["which is the superego, then"]],[2278,["in the center here, on the fontanel bone area,"]],[2281,["a calcification takes place."]],[2283,["And when that happens you develop your I-ness."]],[2287,["You become \"I\", Mr.\" I\", Mr.\"Second I\", Mr. \"Third I\"."]],[2292,["Now, this is like an egg we can say,"]],[2296,["which has to be transformed into a bird."]],[2299,["In Sanskrit a realised soul is called as 'vijaha', means twice born."]],[2304,["And also a bird is called as twice-born."]],[2307,["In the same way a human being which looks so insipid, so boring,"]],[2313,["so useless, sometimes he also condemns himself for nothing at all,"]],[2316,["sometimes you find him so bombastic, so egoistical,"]],[2319,["so horrible, so aggressive."]],[2322,["All these people are nothing but these little eggs."]],[2325,["Only thing what one has to do is to transform them into the bird."]],[2331,["The bird, that is a free bird,"]],[2334,["which understands what is wrong with you,"]],[2338,["what is wrong with others and how to correct yourself."]],[2341,["Because the Spirit is the master, is the guru."]],[2345,["Your Spirit is your master. You are your own master."]],[2348,["You become your own master"]],[2351,["and you start understanding everything one by one."]],[2354,["I am just your Mother. I'll decode for you,"]],[2357,["I'll tell you what is what, what is this."]],[2360,["Once you understand that and you start finding it out,"]],[2364,["you yourself will be amazed, that"]],[2366,["not only that you can cure yourself,"]],[2368,["you can raise your own Kundalini,"]],[2370,["you can work it out on yourself"]],[2372,["and keep your transformation moving further and further,"]],[2375,["but you become entitled, endowed with powers,"]],[2380,["that you can give realisations to others,"]],[2382,["you can do all these things by yourself,"]],[2385,["and it is such a remarkable thing, which must be achieved."]],[2389,["Because if you see the condition of this world today,"]],[2392,["it is in a very big mess."]],[2394,["I don't know if people understand it what we are facing."]],[2398,["We are just like the tree as I told you, which has lost his roots,"]],[2403,["and anytime it can be destroyed."]],[2405,["It is very important today that all of us must seek"]],[2410,["and find the Spirit."]],[2412,["Everybody who has told this, they were not liars,"]],[2416,["they are not telling us wrong things."]],[2418,["Traditionally everyone has said the same thing."]],[2421,["Now these gurus can also start some untraditional stuff,"]],[2425,["and people believe it, because it is something new."]],[2428,["This is the higher evolution of a person"]],[2432,["where you arrive at a point,"]],[2435,["where you become the witness of the play of the whole game."]],[2440,["For example a thought rises and falls off,"]],[2442,["another thought rises and falls off."]],[2445,["Between these thoughts there is a little space"]],[2447,["and this space is the present,"]],[2450,["while we live in the present or the past."]],[2453,["But - we live in the present, we don't live in the present,"]],[2460,["but we live in the future or in the past."]],[2462,["Now the past doesn't exist, because it's over,"]],[2465,["and the present (should be FUTURE) doesn't exist at all."]],[2467,["So our thoughts are all the time moving like that."]],[2470,["If somehow you can stop yourself at the point that is the present,"]],[2476,["then you start enjoying the dynamics of every moment which you live."]],[2482,["And that's what is achieved through Kundalini awakening."]],[2485,["As I told you this subject matter is very great."]],[2488,["In an introduction I have tried to cover lots of points,"]],[2494,["which people have been asking Me all over the world."]],[2497,["And if you have any new points to ask Me,"]],[2499,["I'll be very happy to answer you."]],[2502,["Tomorrow I'll tell you actually"]],[2504,["what happens, when the Kundalini rises."]],[2506,["I would like you to","ask Me questions"]],[2509,["and after that we will have the session of realisation,"]],[2513,["which may take hardly ten to fifteen minutes."]],[2516,["May God bless you all."]],[2519,["Can I have questions from you?"]],[2538,["You have a question? Anyone with questions..."]],[2541,["This is the best way to openly talk."]],[2545,["Did You say the mind is the Spirit?"]],[2548,["Did You say the mind is the Spirit?"]],[2551,["No, tomorrow I'll tell you the difference,"]],[2553,["but if you want I tell you mind and Spirit are two different things."]],[2561,["In English language what we call mind it's a confusing thing."]],[2567,["But it's simple to understand."]],[2572,["Now here you see is an institution,"]],[2577,["which looks like a blue balloon in the head."]],[2582,["That is the mind."]],[2585,["It is created by the action of the power of desire."]],[2593,["which we call in psychology as superego,"]],[2597,["which is the result of all our conditionings, is the mind."]],[2601,["You can call it manasa. In Sanskrit language is manasa."]],[2604,["Now on the right side, the yellow coloured line, you see,"]],[2611,["ends up into another yellow coloured institution,"]],[2615,["is a result or a by-product of our activity,"]],[2622,["physical and through our brain, which we call as mental."]],[2628,["This creates an institution called ego."]],[2633,["So we have got superego as well as ego."]],[2637,["Supposing you tell somebody, \"Don't do like this."]],[2640,["It is not to be done. You have to be disciplined like that.\""]],[2644,["Then, if you go too much with it,"]],[2646,["then conditioning takes place in a person."]],[2648,["And these conditionings are expressed as a balloon there,"]],[2654,["which is a by-product of conditionings."]],[2657,["And the another one is the by-product of our activity,"]],[2662,["which is mental as well as physical."]],[2666,["So we have two things, one is the manasa, is mana."]],[2672,["I don't know, in English it is called as mind,"]],[2675,["but it is confusion, because they call a mental case to a mad man and"]],[2681,["when you work through your brain, you call it a mental activity."]],[2685,["So I would suggest, that if the confusion has to be understood,"]],[2690,["has to be understood properly."]],[2692,["What happens to a man who works through his brain too much,"]],[2698,["gets a heart attack."]],[2699,["It's surprising, he should get something wrong there -"]],[2703,["but no, he gets a heart attack."]],[2705,["A man, who works for the future through his mental capacity,"]],[2709,["gets a heart attack, means a balance."]],[2712,["And then a man, who works with his emotions too much,"]],[2718,["gets this brain which is degenerated, so you call it mental."]],[2723,["So because of this the confusion is there, because of the balance."]],[2728,["It's surprising, that in a mental hospital"]],[2730,["you don't need anything to find out about heart,"]],[2734,["electrocardiogram and all that is not needed,"]],[2736,["because a mental case never gets a heart attack normally."]],[2740,["So because of this confusion people call a mental case"]],[2743,["to a person who actually uses his emotional side."]],[2747,["So for all our purposes we use a pure word called superego and ego."]],[2754,["Now apart from that we have got the Spirit"]],[2757,["and the Spirit is in the heart."]],[2761,["It is the reflection of God Almighty."]],[2765,["Another thing we have got down below, is the Kundalini."]],[2769,["Kundalini is the reflection of the Holy Ghost."]],[2772,["And Holy Ghost is the All Pervading Power of God's Love."]],[2777,["So that's how we have these four things separated."]],[2780,["Another thing we have got, which is the attention,"]],[2783,["which is sustained by our liver."]],[2786,["So now you understand we have a heart, we have an ego and superego,"]],[2791,["and we have got that power which is sleeping,"]],[2794,["which is to be awakened within us, which is called as Kundalini."]],[2799,["In the Bible also it is said that,"]],[2801,["\"I will appear before you like tongues of flames\"."]],[2804,["And what you see is, are these centres, when they are enlightened,"]],[2808,["they look like tongues of flames of different colours,"]],[2810,["as shown you the picture."]],[2812,["But ultimately the thousand petaled lotus here"]],[2818,["has many colours, all the seven colours of the rainbow."]],[2823,["I hope it is clear to the subject."]],[2826,["So far our Spirit has not come into our attention."]],[2833,["Yes, speak."]],[2843,["Is there any danger in Kundalini path being awakened too quickly?"]],[2846,["I'm sorry I should have tackled this question everybody ask,"]],[2849,["it is true. Because so many books have been written about Kundalini,"]],[2852,["which are horrifying things and there is no danger at all."]],[2857,["Kundalini is your own Mother."]],[2860,["She bears all the things, She bears all the problems for you."]],[2863,["She is your own Mother."]],[2865,["She's just waiting for the moment to give you realisation,"]],[2868,["so there is somebody who knows the job!"]],[2871,["But those people who have written about Kundalini -"]],[2874,["I've seen one book which was written, I was amazed how these people,"]],[2878,["could write about Kundalini, all this nonsense"]],[2881,["in such a big book and selling it,"]],[2884,["which has no relevance at all to the state of Kundalini,"]],[2888,["to the nature of Kundalini, even to the seat of Kundalini."]],[2891,["They are so confused, but the realm of God,"]],[2896,["everybody tries to handle, is the sad part,"]],[2899,["that everyone tries to handle that realm"]],[2902,["and they can say whatever they like."]],[2904,["There is no danger at all,"]],[2905,["we have given realisation to thousands and thousands of people."]],[2909,["Of course, when the Kundalini is rising,"]],[2912,["if you have any opposition within yourself"]],[2914,["due to a disease or trouble"]],[2916,["maybe little bit, you might feel hot in the hand."]],[2919,["But nothing more than that, or less than that."]],[2922,["It is a very beautiful experience, very pleasant"]],[2926,["and great pleasure to Me."]],[2930,["Yes."]],[2932,["Is this Kundalini energy active at birth?"]],[2938,["Is it there at birth?"]],[2941,["Is the Kundalini energy present at birth?"]],[2944,["Yes! About two months or so, when you are in a foetus,"]],[2950,["it enters into your being, which is present there throughout."]],[2960,["Is it present before birth?"]],[2962,["No, not before birth, how can it be present?"]],[2965,["You see, in the sense that in the womb it is present."]],[2969,["It is in the womb of the mother, as the foetus it does, but"]],[2972,["before the foetus is formed, how can it be present,"]],[2974,["there has to be something to be present in."]],[2977,["So it is there when the foetus is about two months of age,"]],[2980,["it starts expressing itself there, it is there. All right?"]],[2988,["Should we do any practice for tomorrow?"]],[2992,["For?"]],[2993,["Should we practice anything?"]],[2995,["Should we practice anything...?"]],[2997,["For tomorrow at this level."]],[2999,["I see."]],[3000,["Should they practice anything for tomorrow?"]],[3002,["Could I make an announcement about the workshop?"]],[3005,["All right."]],[3007,["We haven't told you but tomorrow during the day we've got a workshop"]],[3011,["for those who would like can come along."]],[3013,["May be a little inconvenient but"]],[3015,["for those who would like to come along, there's a place for your coming."]],[3018,["Today we'll work it out also."]],[3020,["You can come along but"]],[3021,["we'll make an announcement at the end of the program,"]],[3023,["and the answer is yes."]],[3025,["But Mataji will show you at the end of the lecture"]],[3028,["after you have the experience."]],[3032,["He seems to be a great seeker."]],[3038,["Is there any other question please?"]],[3057,["Is this spontaneous awakening, as opposed to the more dangerous"]],[3064,["awakening that occurs some,  by some people,"]],[3069,["due to Your Power?"]],[3074,["It's very embarrassing."]],[3078,["It is not due to Us at all, that's all I can say,"]],[3081,["but you have got your own power."]],[3082,["Now say for example if there is a light,"]],[3085,["a candle that is enlightened, all right,"]],[3088,["and if it has to enlighten another light -"]],[3091,["is it the power of this candle that you will say that has enlightened?"]],[3096,["Because the candle itself is ready, this candle is enlightened,"]],[3100,["it just touches the other candle"]],[3102,["and that candle gets enlightened by itself,"]],[3104,["because it is just ready."]],[3108,["I understand, from the nature I think that"]],[3111,["You have so many of the yoga teachings."]],[3117,["What's it?"]],[3118,["Periods of starving and endeavour"]],[3121,["hopefully with Kundalini (...)"]],[3124,["and sometimes, it's told, it will be in the next life."]],[3129,["He said, from the reading and traditionally it's said that"]],[3134,["Kundalini rises slowly and it has to be the result of certain things"]],[3138,["and I think he's a little puzzled, how it can be now"]],[3142,["in Your presence."]],[3144,["Have you read Shankaracharya, Adi Shankaracharya?"]],[3147,["He's the master of this, all right?"]],[3149,["What he says that, \"Mother can do it\",  that's it."]],[3154,["You have to find out about Myself."]],[3157,["All right? I'll better not tell you."]],[3159,["To be tactful, one should not talk about oneself."]],[3161,["It's a dangerous thing."]],[3163,["Christ has said, \"I'm the life, I'm the path\","]],[3165,["and people crucified Him."]],[3167,["Just see! You dare not say anything about yourself."]],[3170,["If you say, they will just trouble you."]],[3173,["It's better to keep quiet."]],[3174,["I'll do what I have to do, then you find out about Me. All right?"]],[3178,["I don't want to say anything, because if I say anything, you feel hurt."]],[3182,["But please, please don't misunderstand me, I'm not questioning You."]],[3187,["I cannot..."]],[3188,["I'm trying to find out the balance,"]],[3190,["thinking that spontaneous comes to me."]],[3193,["I personally am endeavoured to the Kriya Yoga."]],[3196,["Yoga?"]],[3197,["Kriya Yoga."]],[3198,["All right. All right. I understand you."]],[3204,["Now, I'll tell you about. Kriya Yoga is against spontaneous."]],[3210,["(...)  completely."]],[3212,["And by Kriya Yoga you cannot get  realisation."]],[3216,["There is no Kriya Yoga."]],[3217,["In no traditional book it is there, no traditional."]],[3220,["This is a new thing started by people,"]],[3222,["they used to even cut the tongues of people,"]],[3225,["say that you put it back here, put the tracheae,"]],[3228,["do all kinds of things. There are many people in India who have"]],[3231,["their tongues waving like dogs, who have been to Kriya."]],[3236,["There's no such things needed at all."]],[3239,["It is spontaneous, it is within you,"]],[3241,["you don't have to do anything about it. That is what it is!"]],[3244,["Absolutely!"]],[3246,["You don't have to do anything, you don't have to stand on your head,"]],[3248,["or nothing at all. It's just simple."]],[3251,["So Kriya Yoga is not sahaja."]],[3254,["'Is not sahaja' means"]],[3255,["'saha' means 'with' and 'ja' is 'born'. It's spontaneous."]],[3259,["It is a spontaneous thing, you don't have to do anything about it."]],[3262,["Nothing."]],[3266,["But once you get it, once you get it, you can give it to others."]],[3271,["It's like if you know how to swim"]],[3273,["and if there's somebody who does not know and he is getting drowned."]],[3277,["What you tell that person, that"]],[3279,["\"You keep quiet just now, I'll take you to the shore\"."]],[3281,["Then you are brought to the shore"]],[3283,["and you teach him how to swim, and then he can save others also."]],[3287,["But the one who does not know how to swim,"]],[3289,["has to do nothing for the time being, just to get his realisation,"]],[3294,["mature in it and then give realisation to others."]],[3297,["No Kriya is needed at all in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3300,["Actually it is not at all traditional."]],[3302,["It is a very recent stuff that has come out."]],[3304,["If you read from the past, if you read Adi Shankaracharya,"]],[3308,["the sixth century, if you read other people, Markandeya like,"]],[3310,["fourteenth century, you'll be amazed, that"]],[3313,["they have said the same thing what I am saying; this is traditional."]],[3317,["But these new gurus came up, they started talking about this and that,"]],[3321,["but it is not so."]],[3323,["Nobody can achieve realisation by Kriya Yoga."]],[3326,["I've not met one. On the contrary they come to Me as patients."]],[3329,["I must say, I'm sorry to say, but it is so."]],[3332,["People have spent so much money,"]],[3334,["from India they have gone all the way to America to do Kriya Yoga"]],[3338,["and they are just suffering. Nobody has achieved anything."]],[3341,["So now whatever you have done, it's finished."]],[3344,["Now you be interested in yourself and in your seeking."]],[3346,["Just forget it whatever you have done."]],[3349,["Now what you have to do is,"]],[3350,["to just get your realisation and work it out."]],[3353,["Forget it whatever you have been doing,"]],[3356,["because you have not yet achieved the result."]],[3358,["So forget it!"]],[3359,["And see for yourself without any Kriya you receive it or not."]],[3363,["It is all described but the trouble is,"]],[3366,["all the Sanskrit books which are authentic are not being translated."]],[3370,["So it's not traditional at all."]],[3372,["Christ never said you have to do anything like that."]],[3376,["Nobody has said it. Everybody has talked of spontaneous happening."]],[3380,["Even Martin Luther, when he tried to change people from Catholicism,"]],[3384,["he talked of spontaneity."]],[3386,["He was also a realised soul, but later on his followers"]],[3389,["tried to make a mess of everything."]],[3391,["In the same way Christ also talked of the same thing."]],[3394,["Did they say that you have to stand on your head, cut your tongues,"]],[3396,["put them back, push it back?"]],[3398,["All these things are absolutely not to be done."]],[3401,["It's very harmful, one should never do it."]],[3413,["So let us have now the experiment, all right?"]],[3415,["All of you are seekers."]],[3417,["Now forget what you have been doing, what is done, forget it."]],[3421,["Because you have been -"]],[3422,["you have to be kind to yourself, to be truthful to yourself,"]],[3426,["you have to be your Self."]],[3427,["I'm the only person who'll say that you have to get to it."]],[3431,["If you don't get it, I will not rest and you should not rest."]],[3433,["If I have patience for you, you should also have patience for you."]],[3436,["Don't be angry with anyone, don't be angry with yourself,"]],[3439,["don't be angry with your gurus,"]],[3441,["whatever has happened has happened, doesn't matter."]],[3443,["You'll be amazed, I Myself get surprised the way Divine is working."]],[3449,["Whatever you may do it, whatever may be the problems, it works,"]],[3453,["it works, really it works."]],[3454,["It's something so amazing."]],[3456,["It is better that you see to it, that you get it."]],[3459,["Because you are seekers of ages."]],[3461,["This is not a life you are wasting, you have been seeking for ages."]],[3464,["And today the time has come, that's why you are here to get it."]],[3468,["So please just get your realisation. Forget the past."]],[3472,["May God bless you all."]],[3492,["I would request you for a simple thing:"]],[3494,["we have to take out our shoes,"]],[3496,["because the Mother Earth also takes away our problems."]],[3498,["She's very helpful. Even the light is helpful."]],[3500,["Now some people ask, \"Why the light?\" Even this little light"]],[3503,["is so helpful, if it is there. Just take out your shoes."]],[3507,["Just to take help from the Mother Earth. It's very simple."]],[3512,["Now you have to put your both the hands towards Me like this"]],[3516,["in a very simple way."]],[3517,["First of all you should be comfortably seated."]],[3519,["There should be no discomfort,"]],[3521,["so that when it is happening you again get distracted."]],[3523,["Just to sit comfortably, have easy sitting,"]],[3527,["no, no tightening in the neck or in the -"]],[3536,["I mean uncomfortable tightening."]],[3538,["It's all right, if you can feel comfortable."]]]);
